note or suffix markers of the decimal path: 0x1e is 30, 0x1f32 is 7986. Values from Wolfram (wolfram.txt).
om2
fn main to int
a = ulong 0xe
putu a
a = ulong 0xf
putu a
a = ulong 0x1e
